                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="mt-2 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 text-[10px] font-semibold text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-1">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs">public</span>
                            <span>Akses Setara Warga</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Card 3: Berbasis Data & AI -->
                    <div
                        class="glass-card p-3 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-purple-600 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-xs transition flex flex-col justify-between bg-white">
                        <div class="space-y-1">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span
                                    class="text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-purple-100 text-purple-800">Data
                                    & AI</span>
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-purple-700 text-base">psychology</span>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs leading-snug">Berbasis Data & AI</h4>
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                                Merancang ulang proses layanan dengan AI, Big Data, dan interoperabilitas data terbuka
                                antar-sektor.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="mt-2 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 text-[10px] font-semibold text-purple-700 flex items-center gap-1">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xs">auto_awesome</span>
                            <span>Birokrasi Cerdas</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Card 4: Kolaborasi & Eliminasi Silo -->
                    <div
                        class="glass-card p-3 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-amber-600 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-xs transition flex flex-col justify-between bg-white">
                        <div class="space-y-1">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span
                                    class="text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100 text-amber-800">Non-Silo</span>
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-amber-600 text-base">join_full</span>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs leading-snug">Komitmen Bersama</h4>
